  exposure:I('EXECUTIVE / OPERATIONAL EXPOSURE','What can our AI affect?','Identify the AI systems and supported tool/action paths that could change important business records, customer data, financial operations or infrastructure.','Prioritize attention and ownership around consequential capability rather than the number of AI applications in the estate.','Start from a system, goal or qualified source. HAIEC can build system and action maps where source identity and relationships are established.','An inventory entry, potential path or source name is not proof that every effect is reachable or already observed.','◎'),
